**sdllp.hpp resolves dynamic-library exports through `sdllp`.**

## Interface

- `sdllp::get_export(const char* function, const char* library) -> FARPROC` resolves a named export.

## Internals

- `sdllp::libraries` caches `std::string` library names to `HINSTANCE` handles.
- `sdllp::load_library(const char* library)` loads libraries; `sdllp::is_loaded(const char* library)` checks cache state.
- `sdllp::log(const char* message, ...)` emits variadic diagnostic messages.